  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 600) #12622, eff 9-21-18; ss by #13187, eff 4-13-21 (formerly Plc 402.03); ss by #14631, eff 9-21-26, EXPIRES: 9-21-36 (formerly Plc 602.03)",
